{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國仁川市一座大型綜合購物商場周二（13日）下午發生持刀傷人案。</p><p>一名男子在商場內襲擊民眾，造成至少1人心跳停止、另有6至8人受傷。</p><p>警方接報到場，當場逮捕涉事男疑犯，正調查其犯罪動機及經過。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T07:00:55.261840+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T06:29:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T06:57:42.096866+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:57:42.096866+00:00","content_hash":"497d80cce1331391afbbc1dcd7e3a65b90d8ab970c78c502a9795e51f1c6be9c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}